==Event Information==
Thanks to all our loyal players for helping THE BATTLE CATS reach 23 million downloads!
To show our appreciation, we'll be giving you {{Color|#FF00FF|'''20 Cat Food'''}} once every day until April 13th! ALL RIGHT!!!

Even with 23 million players around the world, the quest of the fighting felines is far, far from over...
We've got more cool content in the works for you, so keep an eye out as we release more details!

